title: berth
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Amiable Dev
    alias: amiable-dev
    email: chris@amiable.dev
repository-code: https://github.com/amiable-dev/berth
url: https://github.com/amiable-dev/berth
abstract: >-
  Advisory port registry, reconciler and dashboard for concurrent agent
  sessions on one machine. A decodable port scheme, a daemonless lease ledger,
  a reconciler that attributes live listeners to projects, worktrees, Docker
  containers and Claude Code sessions, a CLI with a --json boundary, and a
  local dashboard with a port-range map.
keywords:
  - ports
  - dev-server
  - claude-code
  - agents
  - registry
  - localhost
  - developer-tools
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-13
